\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  The Church's one foundation\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Is Jesus Christ her Lord:
\par She is his new creation
\par By water and the word;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par From heaven he came and sought her
\par To be his holy bride'
\par With his own blood he bought her,
\par And for her life he died.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Called forth from every nation,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Yet one o'er all the earth,
\par Her charter of salvation:
\par One Lord, one faith, one birth.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par One holy name she blesses,
\par And shares one holy food,
\par As to one hope she presses,
\par With every grace endued.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In toil and tribulation,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 And tumult of her war,
\par She waits the consummation
\par Of peace for evermore,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Till with the vision glorious
\par Her longing eyes are best,
\par And the great Church victorious
\par Shall be the Church at rest.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Yet she on earth hath union
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 With God the Three in one,
\par And mystic sweet communion
\par With those whose rest is won.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O happy ones and holy!
\par Lord, give us grace that we,
\par Like them, the meek and lowly,
\par \pard       On high may dwell with Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

